---
/**
 * /entertainment — RETIRED (PUB-A, 2026-07-27).
 *
 * Per ACTION-PLAN.md's publication restructure, the site runs two story
 * columns — Adventure Stories and Venture Stories — not three. This route's
 * content (the venture-story chapters: a restored Shelby at Pebble Beach,
 * PitchBoulder, the story rail, "from the archive") moved to /venture, which
 * is now the index of ALL venture stories (see src/pages/venture.astro; the
 * retired "Industry Stories" lane at /work also refiles there).
 *
 * This file is a permanent redirect so the historical /entertainment URL
 * still resolves — the retired page's full content is preserved in git
 * history under src/pages/venture.astro (git-renamed from this path, so
 * `git log --follow src/pages/venture.astro` shows it). Same static-redirect
 * pattern already established in this codebase (see
 * src/pages/venture/makeshift-film-group.astro's PUBLISH_MFG interlock) —
 * `Astro.redirect` emits a working redirect page even under `output: "static"`,
 * base-path-aware for both staging (/asm-site) and production (/) builds.
 */
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
return Astro.redirect(`${base}/venture`);
---
